  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once a pairtree node is created (implicitly) there's currently no way to create a resource at that location without first deleting that node (which would result in the removal of the resource you explicitly created).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Update fedora to support operations against paths that have pairtree nodes as if those pairtree nodes didn't exist.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
