  "description": "<p>Once a pairtree node is created (implicitly) there's currently no way to create a resource at that location without first deleting that node (which would result in the removal of the resource you explicitly created).</p>\n\n<p>Update fedora to support operations against paths that have pairtree nodes as if those pairtree nodes didn't exist.</p>",
